    player modal. It posts id, thumbnail, title, release date, and duration to
    /api/youtube_bookmark and shows a "Bookmarked ✓" state afterwards.
  app/chat_server.py
  - /api/youtube_bookmark appends a JSON Lines entry to
    .chat/youtube_video_bookmark.json, newest last. Re-bookmarking a video
    moves its entry to the end, and the file is capped at 500 entries by
    dropping the oldest ones. Writes are atomic.
